- [Vibe Marketing](https://www.fotor.com/vibe-marketing/): A visual-driven approach scaling aesthetic intent into high-converting content.
Fotor's Vibe Marketing Platform empowers users with **Product Visuals** (upgrading raw product photos into studio-quality shots with AI scene generation and 3D product staging) and **Growth Visuals** (converting brand vibe into viral social content with AI Marketing Video, Link to Video Ad, AI UGC Avatar, and AI Brand Kit).
