- [URL to Video](https://www.fotor.com/ai-video-generator/url-to-video/): Paste any product URL (Amazon, eBay, Shopify, Walmart, etc.) and instantly generate a high-converting video ad — AI automatically parses product content and renders professional marketing video in seconds.

